==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 1

==Battleground==
*1 [[H. Nah]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[R.Ost]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Youcan]] spawns as the boss.
*Infinite [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>, delay 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Do not bother with this stage unless you have all [[anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] from Cats of the Cosmos Chapter 1 at a bare minimum.

Bring defensive [[Cat Combo|Combos]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and something to kill Youcan, as well as the [[Ototo Corps|Thunderbolt Cannon]]. Kill Youcan, then let R.Ost spawn and reach your base. Do not let him reach it too fast, as you'll need the Cannon, so also use something to slow down R.Ost in case of need. Let him hit your base for a second and fire the Thunderbolt Cannon or time Bahamut well to kill the R.Ost. Based on timing, Bahamut's level and R.Ost's luck with [[Critical Hit|Crits]], Bahamut may win and proceed to cripple or kill H.Nah, at which point you may need to let Bahamut destroy the enemy base or summon something like [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] to finish off H.Nah. If Bahamut loses, use [[Lone Cat and Kitten (Rare Cat)|Vendor Cat and Kitten]] to gain time and distance on R.Ost, then damage him further as he comes back and repeat, then do the same thing for H.Nah, possibly involving another Bahamut.

